### Couple Item Gacha (Fixed 1,000P)
- AI-generated adult couple item for consensual intimate / mana charging scenes between {{user}} and a 동료. Stored as a 차원주머니 consumable item.
- Adult-only and consent-first: all participants MUST be clearly adult, conscious, willing, and able to stop. The item may intensify sensation or mana resonance, but MUST NOT remove consent, impair agency, drug someone unknowingly, force obedience, or make refusal impossible.
- Valid use locations: 성소, 성역, or another clearly safe/private rest space. Do NOT use during combat, dungeon corridors, coercive scenes, punishment scenes, or with unwilling participants.
- Tag: `[SYSTEM|GACHA: Couple Item Acquired - ENGLISH (한글) | 짧은설명 | ⭐:N | 효과]` + `[SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 한글]` (single-use unless explicitly described as a wearable keepsake; mechanically treat as one use).
- The 한글효과설명 MUST follow the EFFECT DESCRIPTION FORMAT below. Lua stores it in cv_itemDetails and the side panel displays it to {{user}}.

## EFFECT DESCRIPTION FORMAT (MANDATORY - parens-safe for SYSTEM tag)
Format: `(효과 타입) 효과 설명. 회복: +N MANA` OR `(효과 타입) 다음 충전 장면 효과: +N%` OR `(효과 타입) 효과: 구체적 1회 보조`
- Use parens `( )`. NEVER use `[ ]` inside effect text because it closes the SYSTEM tag.
- Required effect prefixes: `(즉시마나회복)` / `(다음충전증가)` / `(성소충전보너스)` / `(긴장완화)` / `(유대강화)`
- Concrete values required. No vague "마나가 회복된다" without a number.

## POWER RANGE BY TIER
- 1★: +10~18 MANA or next charge +10%
- 2★: +18~25 MANA or next charge +15%
- 3★: +25~35 MANA or next charge +20%
- 4★: +35~50 MANA or next charge +30%
- 5★: +50~70 MANA or next charge +45%
- 긴장완화 / 유대강화 types may use a smaller mana number plus a one-scene narrative support effect.

## 3-Tier Category Selection (MANDATORY)
If [GACHA_CATS:커플|CAT1|CAT2|CAT3] is present, use those exact categories. Otherwise roll independently.

카테고리_1 - Style/Origin:
고대 / 중세 / 근대 / 현대 / 미래 / 외계 / 판타지 / 이세계

