## NAMING RULES
Do NOT simply prefix the category word. Avoid boring names like "현대 로터" or "판타지 란제리". Use evocative names that imply the category.
- ✅ GOOD: "심박 공명 바이브", "달열매 윤활제", "칠흑 리본 하네스", "쌍월의 감응 향수"
- ❌ FORBIDDEN: "미래 성인장난감", "중세 구속구", "판타지 최음제"

## REQUIRED OUTPUT PER COUPLE GACHA
1. Validate 성소 location and points first. If insufficient, refuse with SYS_ADVICE and output no tags.
2. Deduct cost: `[SYSTEM|POINT:-1000P 커플 가챠]`
3. Output result tag: `[SYSTEM|GACHA: Couple Item Acquired - ENGLISH (한글) | 짧은설명 | ⭐:N | 효과]`
4. Add inventory tag: `[SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 한글]`

## FORBIDDEN
- No minors, youthful framing, non-consensual use, sleep/unconscious use, forced intoxication, mind-control, blackmail, punishment, or inability to refuse.
- No permanent combat stats. Couple items are consumable/rest-scene support only. Do NOT output ATTACK/DEFENSE/LUCK/MAX_* tags.
- Do NOT use square brackets inside effect text.
